\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Show me any other new name
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 there's no Saviour on this earth,
\par except our Lord and Christ Jesus,
\par the only one name we know.
\par It is one and only name
\par that sets all the sinners free.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Father, we give thanks and praise you
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 for the name of Jesus Christ;
\par Jesus, you have this name of life
\par  We give praise to you, O Lord.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Spirit, you are most honnoured
\par and your name is magnified.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Teach us the meaning of your name,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For us to use for your work,
\par and to speak, and use in our pray'r,
\par until even in our death!
\par That someday we shall receive
\par \pard      everlasting life our price.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

